WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.772
Inside a collection, tap +
and choose “New category”.

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:08.872
Pick an icon for the category.

00:00:08.872 --> 00:00:14.172
Type its name and tap Create.

00:00:14.172 --> 00:00:19.672
There it is. With its ⋮ menu
you can edit or delete it.

00:00:19.672 --> 00:00:23.472
Tap it to open it and start saving.

